ost half a year (and in private testing for a year and a half) with a number of people asking for a true \"release\" on a larger platform. Steam Early Access offers us a better way of distributing RPG Architect to a larger group of people.\n\nRPG Architect's goal is to make a game development environment, inspired by the community. As such, we want the wider community to help shape how RPG Architect gets to its full Release version, as well as beyond!\u201d", "themes": [{"id": 34, "name": "Educational"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/rpg-architect", "videos": [{"id": 82782, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "Fp1TYxVO8i8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fp1TYxVO8i8", "title": "RPG ARCHITECT - Early Access Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Fp1TYxVO8i8/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}